<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Linear Tech started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Linear Tech started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James analyst Shekhar Wadekar said he initiated coverage of Linear Technology Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said orders of linear components have been growing since last December.</p>
<p>-- said expects growth to improve in second half of year.</p>
<p>-- said likes company's strategy of focusing on high end of analog segment.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 earnings $1.66 a share, compared with $1.72 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1998 earnings $2.07 a share.</p>
</text>
